{"resourceIdentifier":"3016","resourceName":"Guoyang MSW Landfill Site LFG Recovery and Comprehensive Utilization Project","description":"Guoyang MSW Landfill Site LFG Recovery and Comprehensive Utilization Project (hereafter referred to as the project) is located in Wangqiao Village, Chudian Town, Guoyang County, Bozhou City, Anhui Province, P.R. China. The project is invested, constructed and operated by Guoyang Baichang Renewable Energy Co., Ltd. The objective is to collect the landfill gas (LFG) from Guoyang MSW landfill site (hereafter referred to as Guoyang landfill site) and utilize it to generate electricity.\r\nGuoyang landfill site is located in Wangqiao Village, Chudian Town, Guoyang County, Bozhou City. The project has a total designed capacity 4MW (8*500kW) and combusts the LFG, which contains nearly 50% of methane, to generate electricity and export it to the East China Power Grid (ECPG). The project started construction in December 2019 and started operation on 18/01/2021. \r\nThe project collects and utilizes LFG from Guoyang landfill site for power generation, which would otherwise be released into the atmosphere. Methane in the LFG has been emitted to the atmosphere since the landfill started operation. Therefore the project avoids methane emissions and, at the same time, electricity is generated from a renewable energy source, instead of being provided by the grid. \r\nThe total power generation during the crediting period is estimated to be 127,526 MWh. The estimated annual average emission reduction generated by the project over the crediting period is 62,295 tCO2e per year by avoiding the CH4 emissions from the landfill and the CO2 emissions from the fossil fuel power plants in the ECPG.","location":{"latitude":33.445697,"longitude":116.151028},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2022-05-25","endExclusive":"2022-06-25","endInclusive":"2022-06-24"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"3016"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Henan BCCY Environmental Energy CO.,LTD."},{"type":"string","value":"Henan, China"},{"type":"string","value":"86 371 6552 1782"},{"type":"string","value":"lwang@bccynewpower.com"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"3016"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"62295"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"LGAI Technological Center, S.A. (Applus+ Certification)"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"26/10/2023"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 18/01/2021 - 17/01/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=67133&IDKEY=f0e98hfalksuf098fnsdalfkjfoijmn4309JLKJFjlaksjfla9992576407","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project-Description-Guoyang-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-05-25T13:46:21.25Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=63428&IDKEY=jiquwesdfmnk0iei23nnm435oiojnc909dsflk9809adlkmlkf387467212","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"VCS-Listing-Representation-Single-Representor-Guoyang.pdf","uploadDate":"2022-03-16T07:24:39.327Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=101077&IDKEY=riofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq3a139385183","do